Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.93,0:02:55.39,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\c&H4A393F&\1a&H00&\3c&HE2D5D6&\3a&H00&\4c&HE2D6D5&\4a&H00&\bord0.5\blur1\shad0.5\t(5000,1000,\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&)}選べるの今日からのひとっひとつ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.60,0:02:58.22,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\c&H4A393F&\1a&H00&\3c&HE2D5D6&\3a&H00&\4c&HE2D6D5&\4a&H00&\bord0.5\blur1\shad0.5\t(2000,1000,\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&)}間違えたらやり直して
